{"hw":"παράλιος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">παράλιος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">παράλιος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">α</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span> or <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span> (v. infr.), <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> = πάραλος, <b class=\"lex-tr\">by the sea</b>, <span class=\"gk\">παραλία ψάμμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">573</span> </span> (lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">γῆ, πόλις παραλία</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ion</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1592</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">700</span> </span>(lyr.); <span class=\"gk\">ὄρνιθες παράλιοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Aj.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1065</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰπ. τῆς Αακωνικῆς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.213a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νησιῶται καὶ π</span>. ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">965c</span> </span>; of maritime plants, esp. <b class=\"lex-tr\">sea-spurge, Euphorbia Paralias</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HP</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.11.7</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Dsc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.164.6</span> </span>; of <span class=\"gk\">πιτύουσα</span>, ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">165</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\